<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Monday it had cut its rating for Dillard Department Stores Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened off 1/2 to 32-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
